msgid "Do not let Contact Form 7 send email — Telegram is the delivery channel"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/settings-page.php:364
msgid "Contact Form 7 shows an error whenever the site cannot send mail, whatever the reason. On a site that delivers enquiries through Telegram, skipping the mail step makes it report the truth. Ignored unless a bot token and a chat are configured, so this can never accept an enquiry and deliver it nowhere."
